  "name": "Pokémon e-League",
  "category": "program",
  "description": {
    "text": "Each month from December 2003 to May 2004, the winners of the Pokémon e-League got a copy with a \"Winner\" stamp in the bottom right corner of the picture, and everyone who attended got the same card without the stamp: Darkness Energy in December, Metal Energy in January, Multi Energy in February, Oran Berry in March, Flygon in April and Salamence in May. All but the Metal Energy and Oran Berry Winner copies are cosmos holofoil. Bulbapedia's set lists use the name for the 2003-2004 Hoenn cycle of the Pokémon League, whose seasons gave the unstamped copies.",
